### Reauditoria Adversarial de `docs/fix-generation-repetition-loop-v2.md`

Auditoria realizada confrontando [`docs/fix-generation-repetition-loop-v2.md`](file:///Users/rodrigosonsino/Documents/Codex/2026-09-11/referenced-chatgpt-conversation-this-is-an/outputs/rodrigo-ai/docs/fix-generation-repetition-loop-v2.md), [`scripts/worker/worker.py`](file:///Users/rodrigosonsino/Documents/Codex/2026-09-11/referenced-chatgpt-conversation-this-is-an/outputs/rodrigo-ai/scripts/worker/worker.py) e o log da v1 em [`docs/audits/fix-repetition-loop-audit-result-v1-agy.log`](file:///Users/rodrigosonsino/Documents/Codex/2026-09-11/referenced-chatgpt-conversation-this-is-an/outputs/rodrigo-ai/docs/audits/fix-repetition-loop-audit-result-v1-agy.log), com validação matemática e execução em Python 3 real (`difflib`, `re`).

